{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sling-A-Thing</strong> is a mind-boggling, laugh-out-loud, comedy action puzzler that will keep you entertained for hours. Dive into a whimsical world where you can transform into an incredible variety of cartoon characters and objects, all to find your way to the exit in the most creative ways possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304530/extras/d73183d0ccc25845acf2bbd9a5e7d523.poster.avif?t=1772875666\" width=500 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304530/extras/d73183d0ccc25845acf2bbd9a5e7d523.webm?t=1772875666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304530/extras/d73183d0ccc25845acf2bbd9a5e7d523.mp4?t=1772875666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quirky, Surprising &amp; Satisfying Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is designed to surprise you with quirky challenges and satisfying solutions. The humor and creativity packed into each puzzle make every moment enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovingly handcrafted levels to conquer</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With lots of unique levels, there\u2019s always a new challenge waiting for you. Each level presents different obstacles and puzzles that will test your wit and reflexes. Selected levels have optional challenges and secrets for particularly ambitious players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform into many different things</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most exciting features of Sling-A-Thing is the ability to transform into more and more different characters and objects. From quirky creatures to everyday items, each transformation offers unique abilities that help you navigate through the puzzles. Heart and ghost, anvil and sun, Turtle and turd, the combinations are endless! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304530/extras/79f93832f8446414ca6eff9f2e85fa46.poster.avif?t=1772875666\" width=500 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304530/extras/79f93832f8446414ca6eff9f2e85fa46.webm?t=1772875666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304530/extras/79f93832f8446414ca6eff9f2e85fa46.mp4?t=1772875666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Transformation Mechanic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The transformation mechanic is truly original, allowing you to think outside the box. You\u2019ll need to strategize which transformation to use and when, making the gameplay both challenging and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a delightful adventure with Sling-A-Thing! It\u2019s the perfect blend of comedy and puzzle-solving action, ensuring an experience you won\u2019t forget. Sling! Transform! Laugh!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"fc3ab7ee027fb1d8b20e511ef27296f843237db6.jpg","localized_name":"Throw Rookie","name":"Throw Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1304530/fc3ab7ee027fb1d8b20e511ef27296f843237db6.jpg"},{"icon":"c07ebba075aa2e1c9762931190240218957ba1b1.jpg","localized_name":"Throw Expert","name":"Throw Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1304530/c07ebba075aa2e1c9762931190240218957ba1b1.jpg"},{"icon":