o use and when, making the gameplay both challenging and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a delightful adventure with Sling-A-Thing! It\u2019s the perfect blend of comedy and puzzle-solving action, ensuring an experience you won\u2019t forget. Sling! Transform! Laugh!</p>","developers":["Navel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304530/header.jpg?t=1772875666","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Sling-A-Thing \u00a9 2025 Navel GmbH & Co. KG","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1304530/1766256917/7e22c451c81d1128226d340725ad327140ae0168/1751218659/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749546292","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1304530/1766256917/7e22c451c81d1128226d340725ad327140ae0168/1751218659/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749546292","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1304530/1766256917/7e22c451c81d1128226d340725ad327140ae0168/1751218659/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749546292","id":256987183,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256987183/b57ec7b192ba60b9229479bd8dfe78298f2d5c8e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749546292"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1304530/874682/38205dcabee4a295f0075b526dcaa9c49198d688/1751218652/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745310038","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1304530/874682/38205dcabee4a295f0075b526dcaa9c49198d688/1751218652/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745310038","highl